  "Least privilege means minimum access.",
  "Use strong passwords for admin accounts.",
  "Scope each account to its task and make elevation temporary, because the control is about what a compromised session can reach, not about who deserves trust.",
  "Accounts are compromised far more often than people are dishonest, so the question is what an attacker inherits when they take over that session.",
  "List every account your project uses, the permissions each holds, and the one task it exists for, then remove every grant that has no task.",
  "Your account is phished tonight. What can the attacker reach with it, and what would you wish you had removed?",
  "Stop reasoning about the person and reason about the session after it is stolen.",
