  "XSS lets attackers run scripts.",
  "Use HTTPS to protect the page.",
  "Encode on output, for the context you are writing into - HTML body, attribute, URL or script - rather than sanitising at input.",
  "The same stored value is safe in one context and dangerous in another, so the only place with enough information to escape correctly is the moment of rendering.",
  "Store a comment containing a script tag, render it in three contexts, and show which encoding makes each safe.",
